<Vertical id="TimeVisibleDemo" title="TimeVisible">
  <Markdown id="tv_intro">
## Time on task

The timer below is running right now. It counts only while this panel is
on screen, this browser tab is foregrounded, and you have typed or moved
the mouse in the last 10 seconds.
  </Markdown>
  <TextArea id="tv_draft" rows="4" placeholder="Type here and watch the clock move..." />
  <TimeVisible id="tv_timer" idleTimeout="10 seconds" debug="true" />
  <Markdown id="tv_readout">
You have spent **{{@tv_timer.value}} seconds** working on this.
  </Markdown>
</Vertical>
